    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To begin the process for a Casual Admin Assistant, start by commencing the reference check"
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "proceed to check the applicants' referees"
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "If an \"Incomplete Referee Report\" is received"
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "the process ends due to the report not being finished on time."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "if a \"Complete Referee Report\" is obtained, send it to archive applications."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "proceed to evaluate and rank the candidates"
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "then the process concludes."
